{"type":"standard","title":"Keith Self","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Keith Self</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q115137462","titles":{"canonical":"Keith_Self","normalized":"Keith Self","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Keith Self</span></span>"},"pageid":70210872,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Rep._Keith_Self_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg/330px-Rep._Keith_Self_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/53/Rep._Keith_Self_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1368084772","tid":"ce9e82f2-91ec-11f1-8fe9-b8dbbb7476db","timestamp":"2026-08-06T23:16:09Z","description":"American politician (born 1953)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keith_Self","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keith_Self?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keith_Self?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Keith_Self"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keith_Self","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Keith_Self","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keith_Self?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Keith_Self"}},"extract":"Keith Alan Self is an American politician, military veteran, and former judge who has been the United States representative for Texas's 3rd congressional district since 2023. He is a member of the Republican Party. From 2007 until 2018, he was the county judge for Collin County.","extract_html":"<p><b>Keith Alan Self</b> is an American politician, military veteran, and former judge who has been the United States representative for Texas's 3rd congressional district since 2023. He is a member of the Republican Party. From 2007 until 2018, he was the county judge for Collin County.</p>"}